{"count":1088,"next":"https://api.afp.mil.ph/articles/?page=8&page_size=100","previous":"https://api.afp.mil.ph/articles/?page=6&page_size=100","results":[{"id":813,"title":"COMMANDER IN CHIEF | Send-off to Indonesia","slug":"commander-in-chief","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/MAY 2023/se.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"567\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/2023/MAY 2023/se.jpg\" /></div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">General Andres Centino, the Chief of Staff AFP, sends off the President and Commander in Chief, His Excellency Ferdinand Marcos Jr, at the Villamor Air Base in Pasay City on May 9. President Marcos was headed to Indonesia for the 42nd Association of Southeast Asian Nations Summit set from May 10 to 11.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">General Centino was joined by LtGen Romeo Brawner Jr, Commanding General of the Philippine Army; LtGen Stephen Parreño, Commanding General of the Philippine Air Force; RAdm Mac Raul Racacho, Commander of the Naval Sea Systems Command; Admiral Artemio Abu, Commandant of the Philippine Coast Guard; and PLtGen Rhodel Sermonia, PNP Deputy Chief for Administration. (Photos by PFC Carmelotes/PAO, AFP)</div>\r\n</div>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/MAY%202023/se.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-05-10T10:57:48+08:00","hits":308},{"id":814,"title":"A LEADER'S PERSPECTIVE","slug":"a-leaders-perspective","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/MAY 2023/is.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"566\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/2023/MAY 2023/is.jpg\" /></div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">General Andres C Centino PA, The Chief of Staff, Armed Forces of the Philippines (CSAFP), served as the lecturer during the Field Study Visit of the Master in National Security Administration (MNSA) Regular Course students of the National Defense College of the Philippines (NDCP) at the AFP Headquarters today, May 10.","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/MAY%202023/is.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-05-10T10:37:23+08:00","hits":303},{"id":815,"title":"AFP, UP Manila forge partnership for training, cooperation","slug":"afp-up-manila-forge-partnership-for-training-cooperation","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/MAY 2023/UPM.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"567\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/2023/MAY 2023/UPM.jpg\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—General Andres Centino, Chief of Staff of the AFP, and Dr Carmencita Padilla, Chancellor of the University of the Philippines-Manila, signed a Memorandum of Agreement on May 10 that will strengthen the partnership of the two institutions in promoting dental advocacy, education, and training in the country.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">The MOA signed at the AFP General Headquarters will support the continuing education of military and civilian dentists of the AFP with the UPM College of Dentistry as the primary training provider. In return, the AFP through the Office of the Chief Dental Service will support the various dental community projects of UP.","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/MAY%202023/UPM.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-05-10T10:26:45+08:00","hits":452},{"id":816,"title":"AFP Chief meets U.S. Army Chief","slug":"afp-chief-meets-u-s-army-chief","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/MAY 2023/us.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"567\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/2023/MAY 2023/us.jpg\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City--General Andres Centino, the Chief of Staff of the AFP, met with General James McConville, Chief of Staff of the United States Army, during the latter's courtesy visit at the AFP General Headquarters on May 10.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">In their meeting, the two military leaders discussed the growing bilateral relationship between the Philippines and the United States, which was highlighted by the recent visit of President Ferdinand Marcos Jr to the United States.","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/MAY%202023/us.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-05-10T10:18:17+08:00","hits":287},{"id":817,"title":"DONATION AND GROUNDBREAKING CEREMONY ","slug":"donation-and-groundbreaking-ceremony","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/MAY 2023/don.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"566\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/2023/MAY 2023/don.jpg\" /></div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">AFP Chief of Staff, General Andres C Centino PA served as the Guest of Honor and Speaker during the Armed Forces and Police Mutual Benefit Association, Inc. (AFPMBAI) Handover of Donation and Groundbreaking Ceremony on May 05, 2023 in Cebu City.","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/MAY%202023/don.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-05-06T11:10:54+08:00","hits":296},{"id":818,"title":"Philippines showcases next innovative concept and wins 3rd place in Young ASEAN Military Medicine Officer research presentation","slug":"philippines-showcases-next-innovative-concept-and-wins-3rd-place-in-young-asean-military-medicine-officer-research-presentation","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/339466099_1274870169792562_738125425753154712_n.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"566\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/339466099_1274870169792562_738125425753154712_n.jpg\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">CPT PORTIA ANGELA C PARILLA MC, an Otorhinolaryngology-Head and Neck Surgeon representing the Philippines, made the country proud by earning third place among 10 delegates in the Young ASEAN Military Medicine Officer (YAMMO) presentation themed \"Next Innovation\" with her research presentation entitled \"A Workshop for Training in Ear Framework Creation Using Silicone Dental Impression Material: A Surgical Innovation for Training\" during the 10th ASEAN Chiefs of Military Medicine Conference (ACMMC) held on 13-17 March 2023 in Krung Thep Maha Nakhon, Thailand. The competition aimed to showcase innovative solutions for military medical care that could be implemented in the ASEAN region.","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL%202023/339466099_1274870169792562_738125425753154712_n.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-05-04T15:45:52+08:00","hits":364},{"id":819,"title":"CSAFP visits troops of Army’s 801st Brigade in Samar","slug":"csafp-visits-troops-of-army-s-801st-brigade-in-samar","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/MAY 2023/vis.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"567\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/2023/MAY 2023/vis.jpg\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City--General Andres Centino, the AFP Chief of Staff, visited the troops of the 801st Infantry Brigade based in Hinabangan, Samar on May 4.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">He was welcomed by its commander, BGen Lenart Lelina, who also provided the CSAFP with updates on the internal security campaign in its area of operations.","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/MAY%202023/vis.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-05-04T11:31:36+08:00","hits":402},{"id":820,"title":"FUNERAL HONORS TO FORMER AFP CHIEF","slug":"funeral-honors-to-former-afp-chief","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/MAY 2023/funr.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"567\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/2023/MAY 2023/funr.jpg\" /></div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) rendered funeral honors to the former Chief of Staff, AFP, General Diomedio P Villanueva Sr (Ret) today, May 04 at the AFP General Headquarters. <span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">The Vice Chief of Staff, AFP, LtGen Arthur M Cordura PAF led the military honors for the former CSAFP where he was joined by the late General’s family.</span></div>\r\n</div>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/MAY%202023/funr.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-05-04T11:27:07+08:00","hits":329},{"id":821,"title":"AFP installs new Internal Auditor, PGMC Chief","slug":"afp-installs-new-internal-auditor-pgmc-chief","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/MAY 2023/ins.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"566\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/2023/MAY 2023/ins.jpg\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City – The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) welcomed the new The Internal Auditor, AFP and the Chief, AFP Pension and Gratuity Management Center (PGMC) in a Joint Change of Chiefs of Office Ceremony presided by the Vice Chief of Staff, AFP (VCSAFP), LtGen Arthur M Cordura PAF on May 03 at the AFP General Headquarters.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">MGen Joel Alejandro S Nacnac PA, who recently assumed his post as the new Deputy Chief of Staff for Reservist and Retiree Affairs, J9, turned over his responsibilities as The Internal Auditor, AFP to Col Rodyer B Dela Peña PN(M), who will be leading the Office of The Internal Auditor (OTIA) in an acting capacity.","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/MAY%202023/ins.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-05-03T11:40:00+08:00","hits":1947},{"id":822,"title":"Two EDCA Sites as staging areas for Tubbataha Reef Search and Rescue effort","slug":"two-edca-sites-as-staging-areas-for-tubbataha-reef-search-and-rescue-effort","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/MAY 2023/ref.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"566\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/2023/MAY 2023/ref.jpg\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City - Two sites of the Enhanced Defense Cooperation Agreement (EDCA) were used as staging areas to help in the search and rescue (SAR) operations for missing divers in Tubbataha Reef.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">Three U.S. air assets stationed in Antonio Bautista Air Base, Puerto Princesa and Benito Ebuen Air Base in Mactan, Cebu are being utilized to help in the ongoing mission to find four (4) missing Filipino divers after their boat sunk in Tubbataha on April 30.","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/MAY%202023/ref.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-05-02T12:19:50+08:00","hits":242},{"id":823,"title":"SEND-OFF CEREMONY | PBBM to Washington","slug":"send-off-ceremony-pbbm-to-washington","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/343828585_1553802458443855_3750816892551759966_n.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"568\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/343828585_1553802458443855_3750816892551759966_n.jpg\" /></p>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL%202023/343828585_1553802458443855_3750816892551759966_n.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-04-30T12:26:50+08:00","hits":220},{"id":824,"title":"PH-US-JP TRILATERAL ENGAGEMENT","slug":"ph-us-jp-trilateral-engagement","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/tri.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"567\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/tri.jpg\" /></div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">General Andres Centino, the AFP Chief of Staff; Admiral John Aquilino, commander of the US Indo-Pacific Command; and General Yoshihide Yoshida, Chief of Staff of the Joint Staff, Japan Self-Defense Force committed to promote trilateral military cooperation during their video teleconference meeting on April 28.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">The conference was held to affirm the PH-US-Japan partnership in advancing a rules-based international order and realizing peace and stability in the Indo-Pacific region. The PH and US generals also welcomed General Yoshida who was just recently appointed to his present position.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">The three generals also touted the shared democratic values that underline their collaboration and agreed to increase strategic engagements in the future. (Photo by PFC Carmelotes/JSDF)</div>\r\n</div>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL%202023/tri.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-04-29T13:10:57+08:00","hits":238},{"id":825,"title":"Shoulder-to-shoulder, Philippines and United States conclude largest Balikatan exercise","slug":"shoulder-to-shoulder-philippines-and-united-states-conclude-largest-balikatan-exercise","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/bks.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"567\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/bks.jpg\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City – The Armed Forces of the Philippines hosted the closing ceremony of Exercise Balikatan 2023 here today, marking the successful conclusion of the largest combined-joint military exercise between the Republic of the Philippines and the United States of America.<br /><br />Over the last three weeks, more than 17,600 total combined troops from the AFP and the U.S. military, joined by approximately 100 members of the Australian Defence Force, trained shoulder-to-shoulder at locations throughout the Philippines in order to increase proficiency in maritime security, amphibious operations, live-fire training, urban operations, aviation operations, counterterrorism operations, and humanitarian assistance and disaster relief.</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL%202023/bks.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-04-29T12:34:01+08:00","hits":347},{"id":826,"title":"Balikatan Exercise 38-23 Turnover Community Project in Baler, Aurora","slug":"balikatan-exercise-38-23-turnover-community-project-in-baler-aurora","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/hc.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/hc.jpg\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">Camp Aquino, Tarlac City, April 27, 2023 - Combined troops of the Armed Forces of the Philippines and the United States Armed Forces constructed and completed a community health care facility in Barangay Suklayin, Baler Aurora, as part of the Engineering Civic Action Project (ENCAP) of Balikatan 38–23.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">After twenty-five days of construction, with the cooperation and team work of the construction team from the 355th Aviation Engineer Wing, Philippine Air Force, and the 9th Engineer Support Battalion of the US Marines, the Community Health Center of barangay Suklayin, Baler Aurora, was formally turned over to the residents in a dedication ceremony held on the project site on April 26, 2023.","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL%202023/hc.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-04-28T13:19:31+08:00","hits":299},{"id":827,"title":"INTERNATIONAL OBSERVER PROGRAM","slug":"international-observer-program","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/343326225_100649976359154_7781580784293521430_n.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"567\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/343326225_100649976359154_7781580784293521430_n.jpg\" /></div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">LtGen Charlton Sean Gaerlan, The Deputy Chief of Staff of the AFP, meets with the foreign military officers participating in the PH-US Balikatan's international observer program on April 27 at the AFP General Headquarters.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">The participants, coming from nine countries namely the United Kingdom, Canada, France, the Republic of Korea, Malaysia, Vietnam, Thailand, Singapore, and Indonesia were given a warm welcome as they were also urged by the TDCSAFP to join the AFP's other international military cooperation activities.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\"We look forward to more engagements. Balikatan is just one portion of our efforts to boost international military cooperation and we hope that you will continue to be a part of this, \"LtGen Gaerlan said./// (Photo by TSg Obinque/PAO, AFP)</div>\r\n</div>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL%202023/343326225_100649976359154_7781580784293521430_n.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-04-27T13:32:08+08:00","hits":371},{"id":828,"title":"AFP Statement on the Appointment of Secretary Galvez","slug":"afp-statement-on-the-appointment-of-secretary-galvez","category":1,"category_name":"Uncategorised","category_slug":"uncategorised","intro_html":"<p><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/Jan 2023/press.jpg\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\" /></p>\r\n<p>The AFP welcomes the appointment of Secretary Carlito Galvez Jr as the new Secretary of National Defense.</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/Jan%202023/press.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-04-27T01:47:37+08:00","hits":3959},{"id":829,"title":"U.S.-Philippine Forces Sink Target Ship for First Time in Balikatan Exercise","slug":"u-s-philippine-forces-sink-target-ship-for-first-time-in-balikatan-exercise","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/343429292_592444949530195_8978863024037958293_n.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"566\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/343429292_592444949530195_8978863024037958293_n.jpg\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">Naval Education Training Doctrine Command, San Antonio, Zambales province, Philippines, April 25, 2023— A combined force of U.S. and Philippine servicemembers participated in a combined joint littoral live-fire exercise today, the culminating field training event for Balikatan 2023.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">Approximately 1,400 Marines, soldiers, sailors, airmen and Coast Guardsmen from both countries took part in the training, which involved detecting, identifying, targeting and engaging a target ship using a variety of ground and air-based weapons systems.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL%202023/343429292_592444949530195_8978863024037958293_n.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-04-26T14:56:07+08:00","hits":241},{"id":830,"title":"Chiefs of Defense Meeting","slug":"chiefs-of-defense-meeting-2","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"> </div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/cd.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"603\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/cd.jpg\" />LtGen Arthur Cordura, the AFP Vice Chief of Staff, participates in the video teleconference meeting of top military officials on April 26 ahead of the formal Chiefs of Defense scheduled in August this year.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">Admiral John Aquilino USN, commander of the US Indo-Pacific Command, led the discussions that solicited inputs on prevailing challenges and other suggestions to the agenda in the ChoD meeting.","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL%202023/cd.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-04-26T14:49:18+08:00","hits":269},{"id":831,"title":"PNP Change of Command | ","slug":"pnp-change-of-command","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/343435355_621567329441286_6986931776523197461_n.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"568\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/343435355_621567329441286_6986931776523197461_n.jpg\" />AFP Chief of Staff General Andres C Centino PA joins President Ferdinand R Marcos Jr and other government officials in the Change of Command Ceremony of the Philippine National Police at the PNP headquarters in Quezon City on April 24. PGen Rodolfo Azurin Jr retired from the police service and was replaced by PMGen Benjamin Acorda Jr. (Photo by PFC Carmelotes/PAO, AFP)</p>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL%202023/343435355_621567329441286_6986931776523197461_n.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-04-24T15:03:06+08:00","hits":275},{"id":832,"title":"Featured talents honor soldiers in a one-night concert","slug":"featured-talents-honor-soldiers-in-a-one-night-concert","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/342769412_753869029748595_6338029960678669288_n.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"567\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/342769412_753869029748595_6338029960678669288_n.jpg\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—Performing artists gathered in the Konsyerto sa Palasyo (KSP) on April 22 for a one-night performance in recognition of the Armed Forces of the Philippines' role in peace and security.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">President Ferdinand Marcos Jr initiated the concert, which was also attended by First Lady Liza Araneta-Marcos, Vice President Sara Duterte, former president and current Deputy Speaker of the House of Representatives Gloria Macapagal-Arroyo, OIC-DND, Senior USec Carlito Galvez and other government officials.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL%202023/342769412_753869029748595_6338029960678669288_n.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-04-23T15:06:42+08:00","hits":221},{"id":833,"title":"Aboard BRP Tarlac (LD601) during Balikatan 38-23","slug":"aboard-brp-tarlac-ld601-during-balikatan-38-23","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/brp.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"565\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/brp.jpg\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">BRP Tarlac (LD601), one of the Philippine Navy’s largest ships, participates in the largest Balikatan Exercise to date.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">The exercise comprises numerous events involving ships, conducted with US counterparts such as Communications Exercise (COMMEX), Joint Amphibious Raid Exercise, Replenishment at Sea Approaches (RASAP), Search and Rescue Exercise (SAREX), Division Tactics Exercise (DIVTACS), and Deck Landing Qualification/Proficiency (DLQ).///</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"> </div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">(Photo  by: BRP Tarlac (LD601))</div>\r\n</div>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL%202023/brp.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-04-22T13:49:49+08:00","hits":303},{"id":834,"title":"Transparency Seal Page","slug":"transparency-seal-page","category":1,"category_name":"Uncategorised","category_slug":"uncategorised","intro_html":"","featured_image":null,"image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-04-22T06:08:33+08:00","hits":3999},{"id":835,"title":"Philippine Army, U.S. Army combat engineers conduct Combat Engineer Simulation Exercise","slug":"philippine-army-u-s-army-combat-engineers-conduct-combat-engineer-simulation-exercise","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/341902198_252028710551397_3918255885603537319_n.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/341902198_252028710551397_3918255885603537319_n.jpg\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">FORT BONIFACIO, Metro Manila - Philippine Army and U.S. Army combat engineers trained together in the Combat Engineer Simulation Exercise which is part of the series of Balikatan Subject Matter Expert Exchanges (SMEEs) at the 1st Brigade Combat Team Demo Range, Fort Magsaysay, Nueva Ecija on April 21, 2023.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">Combat engineers from both armies fired a Bangalore torpedo in the first phase and the Anti-Personnel Obstacle Breaching System (APOBS) in the second phase. A Bangalore torpedo, an explosive charge placed within one or several connected tubes, is used by combat engineers to clear obstacles that would otherwise require them to approach the target directly.","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL%202023/341902198_252028710551397_3918255885603537319_n.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-04-21T15:09:48+08:00","hits":548},{"id":836,"title":"AFP welcomes new chiefs of three offices in the Joint Staff","slug":"afp-welcomes-new-chiefs-of-three-offices-in-the-joint-staff","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/342879413_1682266935551185_6010210212197232831_n.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"567\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/342879413_1682266935551185_6010210212197232831_n.jpg\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City--The Armed Forces of the Philippines formally installed new chiefs of three offices in the Joint Staff of the AFP General Headquarters in a ceremony presided by The Deputy Chief of Staff AFP, LtGen Charlton Sean Gaerlan PN(M), on April 20 at the AFP Headquarters.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">The new appointments included BGen Rommel P Roldan PAF, who formally assumed the Deputy Chief of Staff for Personnel, J1, a position he has held in an acting capacity since March 2023, being the Assistant J1. Before this, he was the Director of the Office for Special Studies of the Philippine Air Force and Chief of the Air Force Strategy Management Office.","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL%202023/342879413_1682266935551185_6010210212197232831_n.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-04-21T13:58:15+08:00","hits":2651},{"id":837,"title":"Amphibious Forces Land in Palawan as part of BALIKATAN 38-23","slug":"amphibious-forces-land-in-palawan-as-part-of-balikatan-38-23","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/340844946_747459146920378_1266974353578574499_n.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"476\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/340844946_747459146920378_1266974353578574499_n.jpg\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">April 14, 2023-Following the arrival of the surface assets in Palawan, an amphibious raid exercise was performed at the beachhead of Brgy Samariñana, Brooke’s Point, Palawan.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">Amphibious raid is usually performed against the enemy. It is accomplished by employing a special force into an area that is controlled by enemy forces. Amphibious raids are commonly quick and swift leaving minimal footprints on the ground.","featured_image":null,"image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-04-19T14:36:54+08:00","hits":358},{"id":838,"title":"IFTAR FOR PEACE PARTNERS","slug":"iftar-for-peace-partners","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/341695654_198567769605106_4104219598969493190_n.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"567\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/341695654_198567769605106_4104219598969493190_n.jpg\" /></div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">The Armed Forces of the Philippines affirms its friendship with all Muslims worldwide during the Iftar for Peace Partners on April 18, a celebration spearheaded by the Office of the Presidential Adviser for Peace, Reconciliation, and Unity for the end of Ramadan.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">The event at the Philippine International Convention Center in Pasay City was organized to gather and recognize \"peace champions\" who fostered peace, amity, and unity amidst cultural and religious diversity. Over 110 representatives from various sectors attended the event.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">","featured_image":null,"image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-04-19T14:16:37+08:00","hits":248},{"id":839,"title":"AFP, DND, Aus Embassy collaborate on Women's Month network exchange activity","slug":"afp-dnd-aus-embassy-collaborate-on-womens-month-network-exchange-activity","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/342469247_546409007686521_5520014968319276925_n.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"567\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/342469247_546409007686521_5520014968319276925_n.jpg\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City – The Australian Embassy in the Philippines, in collaboration with the Armed Forces of the Philippines, through the AFP Gender and Development Office (AFPGADO) and the Department of National Defense (DND), conducted a network exchange activity in celebration of the National Women's Month today, April 19 at the AFP General Headquarters.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">AFPGADO Chief, Col Arlene A Fragé PA, thanked the Australian Embassy for initiating the event and welcomed the participants. \"Let us be empowered and use this not only to our advantage but to be of help to others, to be their voice,\" she said as she encouraged them to take the opportunity to learn about gender equality from the session.","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL%202023/342469247_546409007686521_5520014968319276925_n.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-04-19T14:09:27+08:00","hits":314},{"id":840,"title":"TROOP VISIT | 15IB, 3ID","slug":"troop-visit-15ib-3id","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/342201418_1653578171805686_6314618259926022804_n.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"567\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/342201418_1653578171805686_6314618259926022804_n.jpg\" /></div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">The Chief of Staff, AFP (CSAFP) General Andres C Centino PA, visits on April 19 a Forward Operating Base of Bravo Company, 15IB, 3ID situated in Brgy Haba, Candoni, Negros Occidental. The visit to far-flung military camps and detachments is one of the CSAFP's thrusts to check on the troops' morale and welfare and personally relay his guidance.","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL%202023/342201418_1653578171805686_6314618259926022804_n.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-04-19T14:03:00+08:00","hits":241},{"id":841,"title":" Philippine Army and U.S. Army engineers teamed up to construct the Special Forces School (SFS) ","slug":"philippine-army-and-u-s-army-engineers-teamed-up-to-construct-the-special-forces-school-sfs","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/341699739_1797092930692875_8689148115898546901_n.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/341699739_1797092930692875_8689148115898546901_n.jpg\" /></div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Philippine Army and U.S. Army engineers teamed up to construct the Special Forces School (SFS) Rifle and Pistol Range and a bridge at the SFS Complex in Fort Magsaysay, Nueva Ecija on April 17, 2023.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">The said construction projects are part of the ongoing 38th iteration of Balikatan which involves more than 17,000 Filipino and U.S. soldiers training side-by-side in a spectrum of military operations. Balikatan is a vital investment in bolstering the cooperation of Filipino and American soldiers across the spectrum of military operations and accomplishing shared missions. <span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">(Photo and story by the Philippine Army)</span></div>\r\n</div>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL%202023/341699739_1797092930692875_8689148115898546901_n.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-04-18T14:30:00+08:00","hits":246},{"id":842,"title":"AFP STATEMENT | On the Arrest of Eric Casilao","slug":"afp-statement-on-the-arrest-of-eric-casilao","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/ps.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"850\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/ps.jpg\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">The AFP lauds the arrest of the top leader of the CPP's Southern Mindanao Regional Committee (SMRC) and member of the party's Central Committee. Eric Jun Casilao, by his position, was behind all the atrocities and crimes committed by the NPA in Davao Region. After the fall of many of the party organs and NPA units under him, he abandoned his followers and flew outside the country. He was arrested in Malaysia and was deported to face his crimes here in the country.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">We thank the Malaysian authorities for their assistance in making this happen and in helping our government in its efforts to put an end to the violence perpetrated by the CPP/NPA/NDF in the country. His arrest seals the collapse of the communist insurgency in Davao Region.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Rest assured that the AFP will sustain its efforts to provide a safe and secured environment for the benefit of our people.///</div>\r\n</div>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL%202023/ps.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-04-18T14:25:44+08:00","hits":342},{"id":843,"title":"CSAFP visits Balikatan Exercises, EDCA Sites in Northern Luzon","slug":"csafp-visits-balikatan-exercises-edca-sites-in-northern-luzon","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/341784583_970191940834745_8660111333984562955_n.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"567\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/341784583_970191940834745_8660111333984562955_n.jpg\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City – The Chief of Staff, AFP (CSAFP) General Andres C Centino PA, continued visiting various locations of the ongoing 38th PH-US Balikatan Exercises in Northern Luzon on April 18.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">The CSAFP was accompanied by LtGen Stephen Parreño, Commanding General of the Philippine Air Force, and LtGen Fernyl Buca, Commander of Northern Luzon Command (NOLCOM), with other senior staff of the AFP General Headquarters.","featured_image":null,"image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-04-18T14:20:39+08:00","hits":348},{"id":844,"title":"3 NPA killed, 8 surrendered in series of operations","slug":"3-npa-killed-8-surrendered-in-series-of-operations","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/341753832_937602050909226_1618042925791901488_n.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"1015\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/341753832_937602050909226_1618042925791901488_n.jpg\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City — Focused military operations of several units of the Armed Forces of the Philippines in the past week resulted in the neutralization of three (3) NPAs killed and the surrender of eight ( 8 ) others on separate occasions.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">Troops from the 103rd Brigade encountered around 15 Communist Terrorists on April 12 in Bubong, Lanao del Sur, resulting in one NPA killed and the seizure of firearms and ammunition from the CTG side.","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL%202023/341753832_937602050909226_1618042925791901488_n.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-04-16T14:33:28+08:00","hits":565},{"id":845,"title":"CSAFP inspects Balikatan sites","slug":"csafp-inspects-balikatan-sites","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/340835068_935458814157945_6131210472256066018_n.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"567\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/340835068_935458814157945_6131210472256066018_n.jpg\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—General Andres Centino, the Chief of Staff of the AFP, visited and inspected on April 14, various sites where the 38th PH-US Balikatan Exercises are being held.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">Accompanied by MGen Eric Nicanor, the Deputy Chief of Staff for C4ISTAR Systems, J6, the CSAFP met with the Filipino and American personnel manning the Combined Coordination Center and the Cyber Defense Exercise (CYDEX) participants at the Office of J6, at the AFP Headquarters.","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL%202023/340835068_935458814157945_6131210472256066018_n.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-04-15T14:41:18+08:00","hits":540},{"id":846,"title":"BALIKATAN PROJECT IN ANTIQUE ON TRACK TO ITS TIMELINE","slug":"balikatan-project-in-antique-on-track-to-its-timeline","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/340636561_776965553977049_2235618421467424682_n.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/340636561_776965553977049_2235618421467424682_n.jpg\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">Camp Lapulapu, Cebu City – Members of the 18th Civil Engineer Group of the US Air Force and the 552nd Engineer Construction Battalion of the Phil. Army work shoulder to shoulder, as the Multi-purpose Hall project in Antique is on track to its completion by the end of the month.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">The project is now 35% complete and the engineering works are now focused on the pouring of concrete for the roof beams and the installation of columns and scaffolding.","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL%202023/340636561_776965553977049_2235618421467424682_n.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-04-14T14:50:10+08:00","hits":303},{"id":847,"title":"TROOP VISIT | JTF-NCR","slug":"troop-visit-jtf-ncr","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/341186212_679276890667642_3327422111707899654_n.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"567\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/341186212_679276890667642_3327422111707899654_n.jpg\" /></div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">The Chief of Staff, Armed Forces of the Philippines (CSAFP), General Andres C Centino PA, visited the troops of the Joint Task Force – National Capital Region (JTF-NCR) on April 13. JTF-NCR Commander BGen Alexei Musñgi PA and his troops welcomed the CSAFP and party.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\"Continue doing your job and always be prepared. Mahalin natin ang ating trabaho, at ang serbisyo natin,\" the CSAFP said as he commended the troops for their hard work and reminded them of the AFP's mission to maintain the nation's peace and stability./// (Photo by Sgt Ambay PA, PAOAFP)</div>\r\n</div>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL%202023/341186212_679276890667642_3327422111707899654_n.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-04-14T14:44:58+08:00","hits":418},{"id":848,"title":"Gen Centino, Gen Yoshida share optimism in PH, Japan military relations","slug":"gen-centino-gen-yoshida-share-optimism-in-ph-japan-military-relations","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/341173405_1552797415211161_659650034006881002_n.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"567\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/341173405_1552797415211161_659650034006881002_n.jpg\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City— Chief of Staff, AFP (CSAFP) General Andres C Centino and Chief of the Japan Self-Defense Forces General Yoshihide Yoshida expressed optimism in the future of Philippines-Japan military relations toward a free and open Indo-Pacific region during their video teleconference on April 13.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">In the call, the two leaders affirmed their countries' shared commitment to uphold peace and prosperity, reinforce democratic resilience, and strengthen relations and alliances, considering both countries' strategic locations in the Indo-Pacific region.","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL%202023/341173405_1552797415211161_659650034006881002_n.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-04-14T13:00:08+08:00","hits":230},{"id":849,"title":"AFP Corps of Engineers celebrates 86th Founding Anniversary","slug":"afp-corps-of-engineers-celebrates-86th-founding-anniversary","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/340626476_1091447194967789_7943616649145880902_n.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"567\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/340626476_1091447194967789_7943616649145880902_n.jpg\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City – The Armed Forces of the Philippines Corps of Engineers (AFPCOE) celebrated its 86th Founding Anniversary with the Chief of Staff, AFP (CSAFP), Gen. Andres C Centino PA, as the Guest of Honor on April 12 at the AFP Headquarters.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">The Chief Engineer, AFP, MGen Proceso S Rebancos PA, led the Office of the Chief Engineer (OTCE) in welcoming the CSAFP during their anniversary celebration.","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL%202023/340626476_1091447194967789_7943616649145880902_n.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-04-13T15:14:08+08:00","hits":764},{"id":850,"title":"CSAFP dons higher ranks to 9 AFP Generals and Senior Officers","slug":"csafp-dons-higher-ranks-to-9-afp-generals-and-senior-officers","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/341009780_621979512697699_5446057866360487374_n.jpg\" width=\"850\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/341009780_621979512697699_5446057866360487374_n.jpg\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City – The Chief of Staff, Armed Forces of the Philippines (CSAFP), General Andres C Centino PA, administered the donning of ranks ceremony to nine (9) AFP Generals and Senior Officers on April 12, 2023, at the General Headquarters.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">Promoted to the rank of Lieutenant General are MGen Charlton Sean M Gaerlan PN(M), the incumbent The Deputy Chief of Staff, AFP (TDCSAFP), and MGen Fernyl G Buca PAF, Commander of the Northern Luzon Command.","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL%202023/341009780_621979512697699_5446057866360487374_n.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-04-13T15:03:01+08:00","hits":777},{"id":852,"title":"Balikatan Exercise Offers Livelihood Opportunity to Locals in Tarlac; Tourism Activity Continues","slug":"balikatan-exercise-offers-livelihood-opportunity-to-locals-in-tarlac-tourism-activity-continues-2","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/341131771_170513198829353_2976614643769515001_n.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"566\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/341131771_170513198829353_2976614643769515001_n.jpg\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">Camp Aquino, Tarlac City, April 13, 2023 - The ongoing Balikatan exercises 38-23 at Colonel Ernesto Ravina Air Base (CERAB) in Crow Valley, Sta. Juliana, Capas, Tarlac, is a big help for small businesses and to the livelihood of the residents of said town after allowing them to set up their food, souvenir, and barber stalls near the area.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">The CERAB in Capas, Tarlac, is among the sites for live fire training for Balikatan Exercise 38-23 in Northern Luzon Command Joint Operational Area.","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL%202023/341131771_170513198829353_2976614643769515001_n.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-04-13T14:58:58+08:00","hits":205},{"id":851,"title":"Balikatan Exercise Offers Livelihood Opportunity to Locals in Tarlac; Tourism Activity Continues","slug":"balikatan-exercise-offers-livelihood-opportunity-to-locals-in-tarlac-tourism-activity-continues","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/341131771_170513198829353_2976614643769515001_n.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"566\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/341131771_170513198829353_2976614643769515001_n.jpg\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">Camp Aquino, Tarlac City, April 13, 2023 - The ongoing Balikatan exercises 38-23 at Colonel Ernesto Ravina Air Base (CERAB) in Crow Valley, Sta. Juliana, Capas, Tarlac, is a big help for small businesses and to the livelihood of the residents of said town after allowing them to set up their food, souvenir, and barber stalls near the area.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">The CERAB in Capas, Tarlac, is among the sites for live fire training for Balikatan Exercise 38-23 in Northern Luzon Command Joint Operational Area.","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL%202023/341131771_170513198829353_2976614643769515001_n.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-04-13T14:58:58+08:00","hits":425},{"id":853,"title":"AFP Chief welcomes the three-time UNTV Cup champions","slug":"afp-chief-welcomes-the-three-time-untv-cup-champions","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/341463725_960584941629464_4349286374247498148_n.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"566\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/341463725_960584941629464_4349286374247498148_n.jpg\" /></div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">The Chief of Staff, AFP General Andres C Centino PA, warmly welcomes the three-time UNTV Cup champions AFP Cavaliers during their courtesy visit at the CSAFP Quarters in Camp Aguinaldo on April 13. The team, led by their head coach Sonny Manucat, is fresh from their victory against the Ombudsman Graftbusters in Season 9 of the UNTV Cup.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">In their short talk, the CSAFP thanked the team for showing discipline and teamwork as AFP Ambassadors in the league. The CSAFP is rooting their victory in their upcoming matchups on the way to another championship. (Photos by Sgt Ambay/PAO, AFP)</div>\r\n</div>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL%202023/341463725_960584941629464_4349286374247498148_n.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-04-13T14:56:31+08:00","hits":272},{"id":854,"title":"Donning of Ranks | To United States Marine Lance Corporal","slug":"donning-of-ranks-to-united-states-marine-lance-corporal","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/341312966_1242870786346000_5870197472999204015_n.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"567\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/341312966_1242870786346000_5870197472999204015_n.jpg\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">Major General Gabriel C Viray III PA, the Deputy Chief of Staff for Civil Military Operations (CMO), J7 administers the donning of rank ceremony to United States Marine Lance Corporal Paley M Fenner today, April 13.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">Lance Corporal Fenner was promoted to Corporal while serving as a Combined Joint Information Bureau (CJIB) member of the PH-US Balikatan Exercise 38-2023. PH and US military personnel witnessed the simple but memorable ceremony at the J7 Office in Camp Aguinaldo Quezon City.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL%202023/341312966_1242870786346000_5870197472999204015_n.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-04-13T14:53:01+08:00","hits":378},{"id":855,"title":"BK Site Inspection","slug":"bk-site-inspection","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/340773911_749353690117099_7489943008279832407_n.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"567\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/340773911_749353690117099_7489943008279832407_n.jpg\" /></div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">The AFP Chief of Staff, General Andres Centino, inspects the sites for the live fire events of the 38th PH-US Balikatan Exercises that opened on April 11. He visits the Naval Education Training and Doctrine Command in San Antonio, Zambales, which will be the Combined Joint Littoral Live Fire Exercise venue on April 26. He also checks the Basa Air Base in Pampanga and the Naval Installation and Facilities, Philippine Navy in Subic, Zambales.","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL%202023/340773911_749353690117099_7489943008279832407_n.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-04-12T15:27:03+08:00","hits":235},{"id":856,"title":"CSAFP meets with USARPAC Commanding General","slug":"csafp-meets-with-usarpac-commanding-general","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/341082015_495764969297265_2017778293270629069_n.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"567\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/341082015_495764969297265_2017778293270629069_n.jpg\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City-- The Chief of Staff, AFP (CSAFP) General Andres C Centino PA, met with the Commanding General of the US Army Pacific, General Charles Flynn, during the latter's courtesy visit today at the AFP General Headquarters.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">The meeting focused on the continuing cooperation between the AFP and the US Armed Forces, particularly in the army-to-army partnership.","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL%202023/341082015_495764969297265_2017778293270629069_n.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-04-12T15:23:53+08:00","hits":224},{"id":857,"title":"AFPMBAI turns over 2-story Modular facility to Philippine Army","slug":"afpmbai-turns-over-2-story-modular-facility-to-philippine-army","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/341079119_719291079979318_9026447669925694033_n.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/341079119_719291079979318_9026447669925694033_n.jpg\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">Camp Aguinaldo, Quezon City – The Armed Forces and Police Mutual Benefit Association (AFPMBAI) officially turned over to the Philippine Army the 2-story modular facility on April 11 at Headquarters Philippine Army, Fort Bonifacio, Metro Manila.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">The Chief of Staff, AFP Gen Andres C Centino PA, and AFPMBAI President and CEO Maj. Gen. Rizaldo B. Limoso (Ret), handed over the signed deed of donation and symbolic key to the Commanding General, Philippine Army Lt. Gen. Romeo S. Brawner Jr.","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL%202023/341079119_719291079979318_9026447669925694033_n.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-04-12T15:20:57+08:00","hits":446},{"id":858,"title":"PH-US troops conduct friendship jump","slug":"ph-us-troops-conduct-friendship-jump","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/340851032_2651098351698723_6167656772297986563_n.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"479\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/340851032_2651098351698723_6167656772297986563_n.jpg\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">CAMP AGUINALDO QUEZON CITY - Fifty-two free fallers from the Special Operations Command Armed Forces of the Philippines and the United States Special Operations Command Pacific joined the Bilateral Military Freefall Friendship Jump as part of the ongoing Balikatan Exercises on April 11, 2023.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">Using two (2) Bell Boeing V-22 Osprey Aircraft of the US Air Force, the freefall and airborne qualified soldiers jumped at an altitude of 9,000 feet above ground level (AGL) and parachuted towards the Drop Zone Royce, Brgy Liwayway, Sta Rosa, Nueva Ecija.","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL%202023/340851032_2651098351698723_6167656772297986563_n.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-04-12T15:18:00+08:00","hits":294},{"id":859,"title":"Philippines, United States officially kick off largest Balikatan to date","slug":"philippines-united-states-officially-kick-off-largest-balikatan-to-date","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/340951898_200745122689486_263343347673699210_n.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"567\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/340951898_200745122689486_263343347673699210_n.jpg\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City – The Philippines and the United States formally opened the largest Exercise Balikatan on Tuesday, April 11, at the Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) General Headquarters.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">With over 17,500 combined troops from the AFP and the U.S. military, the 38th iteration of the annual bilateral exercise will highlight four (4) major events: Command Post Exercise, Cyber Defense Exercise, Field Training Exercise, and Humanitarian Civic Assistance.","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL%202023/340951898_200745122689486_263343347673699210_n.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-04-11T15:29:57+08:00","hits":282},{"id":860,"title":"ARAW NG KAGITINGAN 2023","slug":"araw-ng-kagitingan-2023","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/340068246_6048655918563842_4872079790142076055_n.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"567\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/340068246_6048655918563842_4872079790142076055_n.jpg\" /></div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP), Chief of Staff, General Andres C Centino PA joins the Commander -in-Chief, President Ferdinand R Marcos Jr. in celebration of the 81st Anniversary of the Araw ng Kagitingan today, April 10 at Mount Samat National Shrine, Pilar, Bataan.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">The activity aims to honor the sacrifices of Filipino war veterans during World War II and to remind every Filipino of their heroism and courage in protecting the country. Likewise, the event commemorates the historical \"Death March\" by Filipino and American soldiers from Bataan to Tarlac on April 9, 1942.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">This year's celebration evolves on the theme, \"Kagitingan ng mga Beterano, Pundasyon ng Nagkakaisang Pilipino.\" (Photo by Sgt Ambay PA, PAOAFP)</div>\r\n</div>","featured_image":null,"image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-04-10T15:31:53+08:00","hits":460},{"id":861,"title":"AFP neutralizes 137 NPAs, local terrorists in the first quarter of 2023","slug":"afp-neutralizes-137-npas-local-terrorists-in-the-first-quarter-of-2023","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/340643265_768954957907854_2523382231311706614_n.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"476\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/340643265_768954957907854_2523382231311706614_n.jpg\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City – 137 members of the communist and local terrorists have been neutralized by the Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) following successful focused military operations across the country from January 1 to March 31, 2023.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">Against the communist terrorist groups (CTGs), the AFP neutralized 82 regular members. Of these, 17 were killed in combat operations, 20 were apprehended or captured, and 45 surrendered to government forces.","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL%202023/340643265_768954957907854_2523382231311706614_n.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-04-09T15:34:08+08:00","hits":440},{"id":862,"title":"TRIBUTE TO VETERANS","slug":"tribute-to-veterans","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/339263868_812549247040444_1209847657855482937_n.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"566\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/339263868_812549247040444_1209847657855482937_n.jpg\" /></div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">The Chief of Staff, AFP (CSAFP) General Andres C Centino PA, welcomes the participants and awardees in the Review in Honor of the Veterans on April 5 with the National Security Adviser, Secretary Eduardo Año, as the Guest of Honor and Speaker. The event in Fort Bonifacio pays tribute to war veterans who have served the country with honor and dignity.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">Thirteen living awardees and one posthumous recipient were given plaques in recognition of their service.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">In his remarks, the CSAFP urged everyone to reflect on the values and principles that the veterans defended. \"This is our way of honoring, remembering, and recognizing the valor, bravery, and sacrifice of our veterans. We owe them an immeasurable debt of gratitude,\" the CSAFP said. /// (Photo by PFC Carmelotes/PAO, AFP)</div>\r\n</div>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL%202023/339263868_812549247040444_1209847657855482937_n.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-04-05T15:40:23+08:00","hits":274},{"id":863,"title":"AFP STATEMENT | On the Four (4) new EDCA Sites","slug":"afp-statement-on-the-four-4-new-edca-sites","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/ps.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"850\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/ps.jpg\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">The Armed Forces of the Philippines supports the decision of the President and Commander-in-Chief, His Excellency Ferdinand R Marcos Jr, designating the Naval Base Camilo Osias in Sta. Ana, Cagayan; Lal-lo Airport in Lal-lo, Cagayan; Camp Melchor Dela Cruz in Gamu, Isabela; and Balabac Island in Palawan as the new EDCA sites.","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL%202023/ps.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-04-05T15:38:24+08:00","hits":394},{"id":864,"title":"PAF transports military personnel on R&R","slug":"paf-transports-military-personnel-on-r-r","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/339670201_473902221535899_2782057213242623380_n.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"562\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/339670201_473902221535899_2782057213242623380_n.jpg\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City — The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP), through the Philippine Air Force (PAF)'s C-295 aircraft, transported military personnel availing the rest and recreation today, April 05.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL%202023/339670201_473902221535899_2782057213242623380_n.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-04-05T15:36:44+08:00","hits":328},{"id":865,"title":"Relics of St. Therese of the Child Jesus visit AFP Headquarters","slug":"relics-of-st-therese-of-the-child-jesus-visit-afp-headquarters","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/339744563_1274407096479894_3601974406392608758_n.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"567\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/339744563_1274407096479894_3601974406392608758_n.jpg\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City – The Pilgrim Relics of St. Therese of the Child Jesus were brought to the Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) General Headquarters (GHQ), Camp Aguinaldo, on April 03, 2023.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">With the theme: \"Lakbay Tayo, St.Therese! Ka-Alagad, Kaibigan, Ka Misyon,\" officers, enlisted personnel, and civilian human resources at the GHQ participated in the said spiritual activity.","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL%202023/339744563_1274407096479894_3601974406392608758_n.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-04-04T15:43:33+08:00","hits":228},{"id":866,"title":"AFP installs new AFPCLOAC director","slug":"afp-installs-new-afpcloac-director","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—</strong> The Armed Forces of the Philippines installed on March 31 a new Director of the AFP Center for Law of Armed Conflict (AFPCLOAC) charged to ensure the military's compliance with International Humanitarian Law (IHL) and human rights (HR) laws and monitor violations by enemies of the state.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">In a ceremony held at the AFP General Headquarters, Marine Col Renato Daracan assumed the position from BGen Joel Alejandro Nacnac who was earlier designated as the AFP's The Internal Auditor.</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/Jan%202023/CC1.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-04-01T16:18:56+08:00","hits":1509},{"id":867,"title":"AFP holds Women's Month Celebration 2023 Closing Ceremony","slug":"afp-holds-womens-month-celebration-2023-closing-ceremony","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/338574030_1225974451621657_7212328424130524622_n.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/338574030_1225974451621657_7212328424130524622_n.jpg\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City — The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) conducted a Virtual Closing Ceremony on March 31 for the National Women's Month Celebration 2023 with the Chief of Staff, AFP (CSAFP), General Andres C Centino PA.","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL%202023/338574030_1225974451621657_7212328424130524622_n.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-04-01T16:03:38+08:00","hits":238},{"id":868,"title":"EastMinCom troops neutralize infamous NPA leader in Agusan del Sur","slug":"eastmincom-troops-neutralize-infamous-npa-leader-in-agusan-del-sur","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/338420261_1698417537611086_5565925499081835786_n.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"850\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/338420261_1698417537611086_5565925499081835786_n.jpg\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">NSFA, Panacan, Davao City - Eastern Mindanao Command (EastMinCom), under the leadership of LtGen. Greg T. Almerol neutralized a notorious leader of the Communist Terrorist Group (CTG) during a clash with the troops of the 3rd Special Forces Battalion (3SFBn) under the 401st Infantry Brigade, 4th Infantry Division (401Bde, 4ID) at Sitio Hugmakan, Barangay San Juan, Bayugan City, Agusan del Sur on March 30.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">Government forces identify the slain personality as Emmanuel B. Anub Sr. alias Salem, Executive Committee Member of the North Eastern Mindanao Regional Committee (NEMRC) and Secretary of both Sub-Regional Committee (SRC) Westland and Guerilla Front (GF) 21, NEMRC.","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL%202023/338420261_1698417537611086_5565925499081835786_n.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-04-01T15:55:53+08:00","hits":284},{"id":869,"title":"AFP MODERNIZATION | Inspection of two C-130T fixed-wing medium lift aircraft","slug":"afp-modernization-inspection-of-two-c-130t-fixed-wing-medium-lift-aircraft","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/338865520_658717819301157_6055378640894147940_n.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"566\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/2023/APRIL 2023/338865520_658717819301157_6055378640894147940_n.jpg\" /></div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">The Chief of Staff, AFP General Andres Centino accompanies President Ferdinand Marcos Jr during the inspection of two C-130T fixed-wing medium lift aircraft on March 31 at the Clark Air Base in Pampanga.","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/2023/APRIL%202023/338865520_658717819301157_6055378640894147940_n.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-04-01T15:48:40+08:00","hits":298},{"id":870,"title":"Troops seize three firearms in a clash with ASG in Basilan","slug":"troops-seize-three-firearms-in-a-clash-with-asg-in-basilan","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march 2023/CT1.jpg\" width=\"800\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/march 2023/CT1.jpg\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Camp Aguinaldo, Quezon City--Troops of the Joint Task Force-Basilan and Naval Forces Western Mindanao figured in a series of encounters with a local terrorist group in Kauluan Island, Al-Barka, Basilan on March 29.</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march%202023/CT1.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-03-30T09:28:02+08:00","hits":351},{"id":871,"title":"COURTESY CALL | SECRETARY PURISIMA","slug":"courtesy-call-secretary-purisima","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march 2023/PAR1.jpg\" width=\"800\" height=\"533\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/march 2023/PAR1.jpg\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">General Andres Centino, the AFP Chief of Staff, meets with Secretary Isidro Purisima, the Presidential Adviser on Peace, Reconciliation, and Unity, during his courtesy call at their office in Pasig City on March 29.</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march%202023/PAR1.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-03-30T09:24:44+08:00","hits":531},{"id":872,"title":"Chaplain Service conducts AFP Lenten Recollection, reminds lent as a time to reflect","slug":"chaplain-service-conducts-afp-lenten-recollection-reminds-lent-as-a-time-to-reflect","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march 2023/MAS4.jpg\" width=\"800\" height=\"534\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/march 2023/MAS4.jpg\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City — The Office of the Chief Chaplain Service, Armed Forces of the Philippines (OTCCHS, AFP) facilitated AFP Lenten Recollection 2023, today at the AFP Headquarters.</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march%202023/MAS4.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-03-30T09:21:30+08:00","hits":507},{"id":873,"title":"AFP activates GAD office, appoints female Armor officer as chief","slug":"afp-activates-gad-office-appoints-female-armor-officer-as-chief","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march 2023/G2.jpg\" width=\"800\" height=\"637\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/march 2023/G2.jpg\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City--The Armed Forces of the Philippines activated its Gender and Development Office (GADO) on March 28 to highlight a significant development in its gender mainstreaming efforts.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">AFP Chief of Staff, General Andres Centino, led the ceremony with the new AFP GADO Chief, Col Arlene Frage, held at the AFP Headquarters.</p>\r\n","featured_image":null,"image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-03-30T09:18:20+08:00","hits":525},{"id":874,"title":"AFPHSC, NKTI conduct World Kidney Day Lay Forum 2023","slug":"afphsc-nkti-conduct-world-kidney-day-lay-forum-2023","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march 2023/KID6.jpg\" width=\"800\" height=\"534\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/march 2023/KID6.jpg\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City – The Armed Forces of the Philippines Health Service Command (AFPHSC), in partnership with the National Kidney and Transplant Institute (NKTI), joined the celebration of 17th World Kidney Day (WKD) through a Lay Forum conducted today, at the AFP General Headquarters.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Celebrated on March 9 with the 2023 theme: \"Kidney Health for All: Preparing for the Unexpected, Supporting the Vulnerable,\" the campaign for World Kidney Day aims to raise awareness of the prevention and impacts of kidney-related diseases and to promote the mindset of constant preparedness in times of uncertainties and the importance of kidney health for an individual's overall wellness.</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march%202023/KID6.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-03-30T09:12:48+08:00","hits":357},{"id":875,"title":"TRIBUTE TO SOLDIERS","slug":"tribute-to-soldiers","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xdj266r x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march 2023/TRI1.jpg\" width=\"800\" height=\"542\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/march 2023/TRI1.jpg\" /></div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">The OIC-DND, Senior USec Carlito Galvez Jr, and Dr. Dante A. Ang Sr., chairperson emeritus of The Manila Times, sign on March 27 the \"manifesto of support\" to the first ever \"Tribute to Soldiers\" that will recognize exemplary military personnel.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">Ten soldiers will be awarded based on their contribution in the combat zone; outstanding community service; innovations in administrative and logistics functions; and achievement in education. Each category will have three (3) awardees except the Education category. Special recognition will also be given to military personnel manning outposts in the West Philippine Sea (WPS).</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march%202023/TRI1.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-03-30T09:10:29+08:00","hits":448},{"id":876,"title":"Marine Commandant assumes as the new TDCSAFP","slug":"marine-commandant-assumes-as-the-new-tdcsafp","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march 2023/TDCS5.jpg\" width=\"800\" height=\"534\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/march 2023/TDCS5.jpg\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City--Major General Charlton Sean Gaerlan PN(M) assumed as the new The Deputy Chief of Staff, AFP (TDCSAFP) in a ceremony presided by the CSAFP, General Andres Centino, today at the AFP Headquarters.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">He replaced LtGen William Gonzales, The Inspector General AFP, who was the designated acting TDCSAFP following the retirement of VAdm Rommel Anthony Reyes on March 15.</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march%202023/TDCS5.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-03-27T09:01:45+08:00","hits":771},{"id":877,"title":"AFP Chief visits Samar troops, echoes mission to end insurgency","slug":"afp-chief-visits-samar-troops-echoes-mission-to-end-insurgency","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march 2023/337692672_2240229902845218_2088111817838191885_n.jpg\" width=\"800\" height=\"534\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/march 2023/337692672_2240229902845218_2088111817838191885_n.jpg\" /></div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City – The Chief of Staff, Armed Forces of the Philippines (CSAFP), General Andres C Centino PA, visited troops of the 74th Infantry Battalion (74IB), 2nd Infantry Division (2ID); and the 19th Infantry Battalion (19IB), 801st Infantry Brigade, and 803rd Infantry Brigade, all of 8th Infantry Division (8ID), Philippine Army in Northern Samar on March 24, 2023.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">In his talk to the troops, the CSAFP reiterated his thrusts to eliminate security threats and maintain peace in the country. He urged them to focus and strengthen their efforts in performing the mission to end local terrorism in Samar.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march%202023/337692672_2240229902845218_2088111817838191885_n.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-03-27T08:57:11+08:00","hits":266},{"id":878,"title":"AFP units neutralize five communist NPA terrorists, gain 46 firearms","slug":"afp-units-neutralize-five-communist-npa-terrorists-gain-46-firearms","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march 2023/IMG-ea4363e5deda7f013d9fd24d384226a8-V.jpg\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/march 2023/IMG-ea4363e5deda7f013d9fd24d384226a8-V.jpg\" /></div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—Units of the AFP reported the neutralization of five communist terrorists as the military also gained 46 firearms for the past week as part of ramped-up efforts to end armed violence in various parts of the country.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">Three more firearms were gained in a focused military operation on March 17 when members of the 38IB fought around 20 CTs in Kiamba, Sarangani.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march%202023/IMG-ea4363e5deda7f013d9fd24d384226a8-V.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-03-27T08:45:15+08:00","hits":334},{"id":879,"title":"WOMEN AIR POWER","slug":"women-air-power","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xdj266r x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march 2023/AP.jpg\" width=\"800\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/march 2023/AP.jpg\" /></div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">An all-female pilot of the S70i Black Hawk helicopter transported the Chief of Staff, AFP Gen. Andres C Centino PA, during his visit to the combat areas in the province of Samar, today, March 24, 2023.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march%202023/AP.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-03-24T09:30:55+08:00","hits":418},{"id":880,"title":"CSAFP visits troops in Visayas, relays orders to end armed conflict","slug":"csafp-visits-troops-in-visayas-relays-orders-to-end-armed-conflict","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march 2023/VIS1.jpg\" width=\"800\" height=\"534\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/march 2023/VIS1.jpg\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City— The Chief of Staff, AFP General Andres C Centino PA, visited the troops of the Visayas Command (VISCOM) on March 23 as part of his efforts to personally assess the capability and morale of military personnel as they push for the completion of their mission.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">He was accompanied by members of his staff, including MGen Gabriel Viray III, the Deputy Chief of Staff (DCS) for Civil-Military Operations, J7; BGen Fernando Reyeg, the DCS for Operations, J3; BGen Ferdinand Barandon, the Acting DCS for Intelligence, J2; and MCPO Joe Marie Lucero, the Acting AFP Sergeant Major.</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march%202023/VIS1.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-03-23T08:42:20+08:00","hits":259},{"id":881,"title":"CSAFP lauds PH-India defense relations","slug":"csafp-lauds-ph-india-defense-relations","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march 2023/IND.jpg\" width=\"800\" height=\"533\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/march 2023/IND.jpg\" /></p>\r\n<p>CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City— The Chief of Staff, AFP (CSAFP) General Andres C Centino PA hailed the stronger defense diplomacy relations between the Philippines and India as he addressed the delegates of the Indian Technical and Economic Cooperation (ITEC) Day 2023 Reception on March 22 in Taguig City.</p>\r\n<p>ITEC is India's international capacity-building platform that offers training for civilian and military officials from over 160 countries. Administered by India's Ministry of External Affairs, it has so far catered to 200,000 officials in the areas of defense, artificial intelligence, cyber technologies, engineering and technology, agriculture, health, and governance.</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march%202023/IND.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-03-23T08:39:00+08:00","hits":274},{"id":882,"title":"AFP, The Inspire Studios seal partnership for \"The Rescue\" movie","slug":"afp-the-inspire-studios-seal-partnership-for-the-rescue-movie","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march 2023/STU4.jpg\" width=\"800\" height=\"580\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/march 2023/STU4.jpg\" /></p>\r\n<p>CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City – The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) and The Inspire Studios held a Ceremonial Memorandum of Agreement Signing for the movie project \"The Rescue\" at the AFP General Headquarters on March 22, 2023.</p>\r\n<p>The Vice Chief of Staff, AFP (VCSAFP), LtGen Arthur M Cordura PAF, and The Inspire Studios CEO and Producer, Mr. Francis B. Lara Ho, led the signing, which marked the beginning of the AFP and The Inspire Studios' formal partnership in the production of the movie.</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march%202023/STU4.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-03-22T08:36:16+08:00","hits":236},{"id":883,"title":"PHILIPPINE NAVY CHIEF VISITS TROOPS IN WEST PHILIPPINE SEA","slug":"philippine-navy-chief-visits-troops-in-west-philippine-sea","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march 2023/KIG2.jpg\" width=\"800\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/march 2023/KIG2.jpg\" /></div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">West Philippine Sea – The Flag Officer In Command, Philippine Navy (FOIC, PN), Vice Admiral Toribio D Adaci Jr PN, visited the troops at the different island stations in the West Philippine Sea (WPS), on March 19, 2023.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">Following his visit to Headquarters Naval Forces West (NFW) and the Philippine Marine Corps' 3rd Marine Brigade at Puerto Princesa City on March 17, the FOIC PN also inspected the naval stations located at Macarascas and Ulugan Bay of the same city on March 18. On March 19, Vice Admiral Adaci Jr flew to the Kalayaan Island Group and reached out to the personnel stationed at Pag-asa, Parola, and Likas Islands. He also led the ribbon cutting and blessing of the newly-constructed administrative and research building at Parola and Likas islands. Part of the activities in the island stations are the talk to the troops and hand over of emergency kits and foodstuff.<span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">Vice Admiral Adaci Jr was accompanied by the Commander of NFW, Commodore Alan M Javier PN, on his visits to the said island stations.</span></div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march%202023/KIG2.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-03-22T08:25:20+08:00","hits":253},{"id":884,"title":"AFP welcomes UK Ambassador, affirms continued cooperation","slug":"afp-welcomes-uk-ambassador-affirms-continued-cooperation","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march 2023/UK6.jpg\" width=\"800\" height=\"534\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/march 2023/UK6.jpg\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City— The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) affirmed continued security cooperation with the United Kingdom during the courtesy call of UK Ambassador to the Philippines H.E. Laure Beaufils to the Vice Chief of Staff, AFP (VCSAFP) LtGen Arthur Cordura at the AFP General Headquarters on March 21. The meeting is part of the AFP's international defense and security engagements.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">During their meeting, Ambassador Beaufils and the VCSAFP discussed issues of mutual concern, including regional stability and international maritime law. They also stressed the importance of continued security and defense cooperation and welcomed possible future security engagements between the Philippines and the UK. They also discussed and supported each other's initiatives to maintain stability and security in the Indo-Pacific region against the backdrop of rules-based order and international law.</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march%202023/UK6.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-03-21T08:22:48+08:00","hits":256},{"id":885,"title":"AFP Chief of Staff joins PNP in awarding laudable police personnel","slug":"afp-chief-of-staff-joins-pnp-in-awarding-laudable-police-personnel","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march 2023/PNP1.jpg\" width=\"800\" height=\"534\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/march 2023/PNP1.jpg\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City – The Chief of Staff, Armed Forces of the Philippines, General Andres C Centino PA served as the Guest of Honor and Speaker during the Flag Raising Ceremony and Awarding of Philippine National Police (PNP) Personnel with significant accomplishments in the PNP National Headquarters, Camp Crame, Quezon City on March 20.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The AFP Chief of Staff was welcomed by the Chief, Philippine National Police, PGen Rodolfo S Azurin, Jr.</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march%202023/PNP1.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-03-20T08:19:56+08:00","hits":245},{"id":886,"title":"OATH-TAKING CEREMONY | AFP Selection Board for 2023 ","slug":"oath-taking-ceremony-afp-selection-board-for-2023","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march 2023/CER1.jpg\" width=\"800\" height=\"594\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/march 2023/CER1.jpg\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Chairpersons and members of the AFP Selection Board for 2023 take their oath before the OIC-DND, Senior USec Carlito Galvez Jr, on March 20, at the DND Social Hall at Camp Aguinaldo, Quezon City.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The various Boards of the Major Services and the Technical and Administrative Services will implement the AFP's Officer Promotion System. They are among the military’s main screening bodies that perform the tedious and meticulous task of enforcing meritocracy under the principles of merit, fitness, character, honor, and integrity.</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march%202023/CER1.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-03-20T08:15:28+08:00","hits":381},{"id":887,"title":"AFP Operations neutralize 29 CTGs, 7 Abus, and 7 BIFFs","slug":"afp-operations-neutralize-29-ctgs-7-abus-and-7-biffs","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march 2023/CTG.jpg\" width=\"800\" height=\"533\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/march 2023/CTG.jpg\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City – Military operations conducted by the different units of the Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) from March 10 to 16 resulted in the neutralization of 29 communist terrorist group (CTG) members, seven Abu Sayyaf bandits and seven more Bangsamoro Islamic Freedom Fighters (BIFF).</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Three Communist NPA Terrorist (CNTs) were killed in an encounter against joint elements of the 602nd Brigade, 90th Infantry Battalion, 34IB, and police units in Pikit, North Cotabato, on March 11. On the same day, two more were killed while a caliber .45 pistol was seized by operating elements of 6IB and police operatives in Datu Saudi Ampatuan, Maguindanao del Sur.</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march%202023/CTG.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-03-20T08:12:34+08:00","hits":254},{"id":888,"title":"CHANGE OF CHIEF OF OFFICE | J1","slug":"change-of-chief-of-office-j1","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march 2023/4657D1B0-DC80-44AE-BB3B-64147E281D01.jpeg\" width=\"800\" height=\"533\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/march 2023/4657D1B0-DC80-44AE-BB3B-64147E281D01.jpeg\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) welcomed the Deputy Chief of Staff (DCS) for Personnel, J1, in a Change of Chief of Office Ceremony with the Acting The Deputy Chief of Staff, AFP, LtGen William N Gonzales PA as the presiding officer at the AFP General Headquarters on March 17.</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march%202023/4657D1B0-DC80-44AE-BB3B-64147E281D01.jpeg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-03-18T08:08:45+08:00","hits":2646},{"id":889,"title":"AFP joins Defense and Security engagement in Japan","slug":"afp-joins-defense-and-security-engagement-in-japan","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march 2023/9A636432-28F2-4161-A656-EA1B97610DC3.jpeg\" width=\"800\" height=\"1067\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/march 2023/9A636432-28F2-4161-A656-EA1B97610DC3.jpeg\" /></p>\r\n<p>CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City - An AFP Delegation led by Gen Andres C. Centino PA attended the Defense and Security Equipment International (DSEI) Japan from 14-17 Mar 2023. DSEI Japan is the only large-scale fully integrated defence event that has ever taken place in Japan.</p>\r\n<p>It is where the global defence industry meets the Japanese defence community, supporting the sourcing of the latest equipment and systems, developing international relationships and generating new business opportunities and partnerships between Japan and the world.</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march%202023/9A636432-28F2-4161-A656-EA1B97610DC3.jpeg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-03-18T08:05:34+08:00","hits":333},{"id":890,"title":"AFP, ADF meet ahead of Indo-Pacific Endeavor 2023","slug":"afp-adf-meet-ahead-of-indo-pacific-endeavor-2023","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march 2023/viber_image_2023-03-17_13-59-15-146.jpg\" width=\"800\" height=\"691\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/march 2023/viber_image_2023-03-17_13-59-15-146.jpg\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City--The AFP and the Australian Defense Force (ADF) solidified their partnership ahead of the Indo-Pacific Endeavor 2023 (IPE23) scheduled in various countries, including the Philippines, from June to October this year.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Vice Chief of Staff, AFP LtGen Arthur Cordura met with the IPE23 Commander, Air Commodore Anthony McCormack, at the AFP General Headquarters today, 17 March. The ADF team for IPE23 is in the country to plan for the Philippine leg of the activity which is expected to be held in August. Primarily, IPE23 will focus on territorial defense and island maneuver operations.</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march%202023/viber_image_2023-03-17_13-59-15-146.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-03-17T17:03:18+08:00","hits":298},{"id":891,"title":"The Deputy Chief of Staff wraps up 38 yrs of military service","slug":"the-deputy-chief-of-staff-wraps-up-38-yrs-of-military-service","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City – The Deputy Chief of Staff, AFP (TDCSAFP), VAdm Rommel Anthony SD Reyes PN, was honored with a Testimonial Parade and Review as he bid farewell to the active military service in a Retirement Ceremony conducted at the General Headquarters on March 15.</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march%202023/viber_image_2023-03-16_12-30-38-995.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-03-16T16:58:35+08:00","hits":479},{"id":892,"title":"AFP dedicates Air Force flights for personnel R&R","slug":"afp-dedicates-air-force-flights-for-personnel-r-r","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City – The Armed Forces of the Philippines has dedicated transport flights to its personnel who avail of rest and recreation (R&amp;R) after several months of deployment in far-flung areas.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">A total of 41 troops who are deployed in the province of Sulu under the Philippine Army's 11th Infantry Division were transported through the Philippine Air Force C295 plane and brought to Isabela on March 15 to enjoy their much-deserved vacation with their families and loved ones. R&amp;R is a privilege given to soldiers after long months of deployment and combat duty.</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march%202023/viber_image_2023-03-16_11-48-52-903.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-03-16T16:54:16+08:00","hits":1851},{"id":893,"title":"AFP welcomes UAE National Defense College Delegates","slug":"afp-welcomes-uae-national-defense-college-delegates","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march 2023/UAE.jpg\" width=\"800\" height=\"533\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/march 2023/UAE.jpg\" /></div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City — The Armed Forces of the Philippines Chief of Staff, General Andres Centino, welcomed the delegates of the Study Tour Visit of the National Defense College United Arab Emirates (NDC UAE) at the AFP General Headquarters on March 13, 2023.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">In a brief meeting, the CSAFP greeted the 19-member UAE delegation headed by Brigadier Staff Pilot Khalifa Butti Thani Alshamsi.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march%202023/UAE.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-03-15T16:50:08+08:00","hits":274},{"id":894,"title":"15 new military nurses take an oath, 45 others don higher ranks","slug":"15-new-military-nurses-take-an-oath-45-others-don-higher-ranks","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march 2023/nur.jpg\" width=\"800\" height=\"533\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/march 2023/nur.jpg\" /></div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City — Members of the Armed Forces of the Philippines Nurse Corps took their oaths and donned new ranks during the conduct of the Oathtaking and Donning of Ranks Ceremonies with The Deputy Chief of Staff, AFP (TDCSAFP), VAdm Rommel Anthony SD Reyes PN as the presiding officer on March 13 at the AFP Commissioned Officers Club.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">The Chief Nurse, AFP, Colonel Ma. Dolores M Lim NC (MNSA) presented to the TDCSAFP 15 Newly-Ordered to Duty officers and 45 newly-promoted officers composed of 24 officers promoted to Lieutenant Colonel and 21 officers promoted to Major in the Nurse Corps (NC).<span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">With the duty to care for the well-being of the men and women of AFP, VAdm Reyes congratulated and thanked the newly-ordered duty and newly-promoted NC Officers for choosing to serve as military healthcare professionals.</span></div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march%202023/nur.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-03-15T16:48:48+08:00","hits":457},{"id":895,"title":"Philippine-United States (PH-US) Army Salaknib Exercise 2023 (SN23) officially opens","slug":"philippine-united-states-ph-us-army-salaknib-exercise-2023-sn23-officially-opens","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march 2023/SAL.jpg\" width=\"800\" height=\"448\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/march 2023/SAL.jpg\" /></p>\r\n<p>The Philippine-United States (PH-US) Army Salaknib Exercise 2023 (SN23) officially opened today, March 13, with a ceremony in Fort Magsaysay, Nueva Ecija.</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march%202023/SAL.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-03-15T16:46:16+08:00","hits":407},{"id":896,"title":"AFP joins ‘YAKAP’ fun run to promote Women’s Month celebration","slug":"afp-joins-yakap-fun-run-to-promote-women-s-month-celebration","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City – In celebration of this year’s Women’s Month, the Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) and the YAKAP ng Magulang Movement Inc. conducted a fun run on Sunday morning, March 12 at the Cultural Center of the Philippines Complex, Pasay City.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Hundreds of runners from the AFP, government and non-government employees, partner stakeholders as well as civilian families and youths joined the fun run and Zumba exercise that sought to raise awareness on women empowerment and humanitarian utopia in contributing to nation-building.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march 2023/YAKAP.jpg\" width=\"800\" height=\"533\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/march 2023/YAKAP.jpg\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The military through the Joint Task Force-National Capital Region assisted ‘YAKAP’ in implementing the fun run and provided necessary support to ensure the participants’ safety and security.<br /><br />The YAKAP (Yaman, Kalinga at Pagmamahal) ng Magulang Movement Inc. is a God-centered and family-oriented organization of parents that was founded in 2020. It seeks to promote values formation through solidifying the family and community bonds, raising awareness about womanhood in society, providing skills training and social enterprise, and preparing children to be law-abiding and productive citizens.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">For the past seven years, the AFP has committed to actively support all programs geared towards women empowerment. During the celebration of this year’s International Women’s Day on March 8, the AFP Chief of Staff, General Andres Centino assured the military’s continuous support to all initiatives anchored on the empowerment of all women.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">“We continue to ensure that our programs and policies meant to advance the welfare of women are transformed into concrete actions that cultivate a harmonious, inclusive and productive working environment,” he said.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">While the AFP takes pride from the progress that it has attained in recognizing the capabilities of all its female members, the Chief of Staff said that there is much to be done.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">“The AFP continues to enhance our advocacies in order to establish a progressive environment where women are given opportunities to enrich their skills and optimize their strengths in performing crucial roles in national security and nation-building,” he said.///(Photos by Tsgt Obinque, PAOAFP)</p>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march%202023/YAKAP.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-03-15T16:44:23+08:00","hits":273},{"id":897,"title":"AFP neutralizes 26 NPAs, 5 BIFFs, and 22 ASGs","slug":"afp-neutralizes-26-npas-5-biffs-and-22-asgs","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march 2023/IMG-ea4363e5deda7f013d9fd24d384226a8-V.jpg\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/march 2023/IMG-ea4363e5deda7f013d9fd24d384226a8-V.jpg\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City – The week-long operations by various units of the Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) across the country have resulted to the neutralization of 26 Communist NPA terrorists (CNTs) including 46 of their supporters, five BIFF members, and 22 Abu Sayyaf members.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The AFP also recorded the surrender and seizure of 66 high-powered firearms, four anti-personnel mines, and various explosives and ammunition from March 1 to 9.</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march%202023/IMG-ea4363e5deda7f013d9fd24d384226a8-V.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-03-15T16:42:11+08:00","hits":332},{"id":898,"title":"AFP Chief calls for 'Unity of Efforts' among troops joining Task Force Negros","slug":"afp-chief-calls-for-unity-of-efforts-among-troops-joining-task-force-negros","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march 2023/Unity_of_Efforts.jpg\" width=\"800\" height=\"533\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/march 2023/Unity_of_Efforts.jpg\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City – The Chief of Staff of the Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP), General Andres Centino, called for unity of efforts as he visited the troops who will form part of the Special Joint Task Force Negros on Saturday, March 11.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">\"Kami ay nandito ngayon under instructions ng ating President na magbuo ng isang task force upang magkaroon tayo ng unity of efforts. Ang gusto ng ating president ay magkaroon ng pag-restore ng kumpyansa ng ating mga kababayan dito sa Negros Oriental sanhi na rin sa nangyaring insidente noong nakaraang linggo,\" he said.</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march%202023/Unity_of_Efforts.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-03-15T16:39:40+08:00","hits":213},{"id":899,"title":"AFP welcomes Israel's support to modernization, training","slug":"afp-welcomes-israels-support-to-modernization-training","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march 2023/1.jpg\" width=\"800\" height=\"569\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/march 2023/1.jpg\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—The AFP welcomed Israel's continued support to the AFP's modernization and capability upgrade during the courtesy visit of BGen Efraim Defrin, Head of International Cooperation Division, Israel Defense Forces, on March 15 at the AFP General Headquarters (GHQ).</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">BGen Defrin met with LtGen William Gonzales PA, The Inspector General, AFP, and Marine BGen Noel Beleran, DCS for Education, Training and Doctrine, J8, and other senior officers of the GHQ.</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march%202023/1.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-03-15T16:37:33+08:00","hits":591},{"id":900,"title":"CSAFP meets with Australian Chief of Defense","slug":"csafp-meets-with-australian-chief-of-defense","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march 2023/3.jpg\" width=\"800\" height=\"533\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/march 2023/3.jpg\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City—AFP Chief of Staff General Andres C Centino met with Australia's Chief of Defense Force General Angus Campbell in a telephone call on March 13.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The phone call meeting marked solid military coordination between the Philippines and Australia as partners in keeping the peace and stability in the South Pacific region.</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march%202023/3.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-03-15T16:34:43+08:00","hits":229},{"id":901,"title":"AFP recognizes stakeholders’ support in peace and development","slug":"afp-recognizes-stakeholders-support-in-peace-and-development","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/Mar 2023/03142022  AFP recognizes stakeholders support in peace and development.jpg\" width=\"800\" height=\"533\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/Mar 2023/03142022  AFP recognizes stakeholders support in peace and development.jpg\" /></p>\r\n<p>The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) recognized its partner stakeholders for their outstanding contributions to the military’s peace and development efforts on Monday, March 14.</p>\r\n<p>AFP Chief of Staff General Andres C Centino led the awarding ceremony at the AFP Commissioned Officers Club in Camp Aguinaldo, Quezon City, during the 71st Founding Anniversary of the Civil Relations Service AFP (CRSAFP).</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/Mar%202023/03142022%20%20AFP%20recognizes%20stakeholders%20support%20in%20peace%20and%20development.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-03-14T08:36:06+08:00","hits":518},{"id":902,"title":"AFP joins mustering of SRR units, national earthquake drill","slug":"afp-joins-mustering-of-srr-units-national-earthquake-drill","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march 2023/83485BA8-6481-4D87-BC31-8988B4959DD3.jpeg\" width=\"800\" height=\"534\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/march 2023/83485BA8-6481-4D87-BC31-8988B4959DD3.jpeg\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City--The AFP's search, rescue, and retrieval (SRR) units joined the mustering of the national government's SRR capability on March 9 at the Lapu-Lapu Grandstand.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The mustering was held as part of the National Simultaneous Earthquake Drill (NSED) to assess the cluster's capacity and readiness to respond to disasters, including the anticipated destructive earthquake called “The Big One.”</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march%202023/83485BA8-6481-4D87-BC31-8988B4959DD3.jpeg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-03-09T16:31:50+08:00","hits":342},{"id":903,"title":"GADvocates of positive change: AFP launches activities for 2023 Women’s Month","slug":"gadvocates-of-positive-change-afp-launches-activities-for-2023-women-s-month","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march 2023/7EA9E081-12C1-47A7-8E1A-BAC17D5CBECD.jpeg\" width=\"800\" height=\"533\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/march 2023/7EA9E081-12C1-47A7-8E1A-BAC17D5CBECD.jpeg\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City – The Armed Forces of the Philippines kicked off today the 2023 National Women’s Month celebration, at the same time the International Women’s Day, with the Chairperson of the AFP Gender and Development Focal Point System Executive Committee and Vice Chief of Staff, AFP, LtGen Arthur M Cordura PAF as the Guest of Honor and Speaker at the AFP General Headquarters.<br /><br />With the 2023-2028 recurring theme: “WE for gender equality and inclusive society,” the commencement of the series of activities for the celebration was welcomed by The Chief, Dental Service, AFP, BGen Angelica DL Torres DC.</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march%202023/7EA9E081-12C1-47A7-8E1A-BAC17D5CBECD.jpeg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-03-09T16:27:43+08:00","hits":210},{"id":904,"title":"PH-US soldiers build schools in Northern Luzon","slug":"ph-us-soldiers-build-schools-in-northern-luzon","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/Mar 2023/03082022 PH-US soldiers build schools in Northern Luzon.jpg\" width=\"800\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/Mar 2023/03082022 PH-US soldiers build schools in Northern Luzon.jpg\" /></p>\r\n<p>CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City – Filipino and American soldiers started the construction of school buildings in different areas in Northern Luzon on March 7 as part of this year’s Republic of the Philippines-United States (RP-US) Exercise Balikatan 37-2022.</p>\r\n<p>The building of schools is part of the Engineering Civic Action Program (ENCAP) being conducted before the official opening of the RP-US Balikatan Exercise on March 28. The activity is undertaken by engineering units and personnel from both the Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) and U.S. Armed Forces (USAF) to improve the infrastructure of local communities.</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/Mar%202023/03082022%20PH-US%20soldiers%20build%20schools%20in%20Northern%20Luzon.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-03-08T16:27:06+08:00","hits":213},{"id":905,"title":"AFP gains new air asset, demonstrates flight capability","slug":"afp-gains-new-air-asset-demonstrates-flight-capability","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march 2023/5AED69AA-CAE4-40DE-8164-D6F7AC5AD2D3.jpeg\" width=\"800\" height=\"533\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/march 2023/5AED69AA-CAE4-40DE-8164-D6F7AC5AD2D3.jpeg\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City – The Philippine Air Force (PAF) conducted an Acceptance, Turnover, and Blessing Ceremony of the C-295 Medium Lift Aircraft with President Ferdinand R. Marcos Jr. as the Guest of Honor and Speaker at the Clark Air Base, Mabalacat City, Pampanga on March 7, 2023.<br /><br />President Marcos Jr. was welcomed by PAF troops led by the Air Force Commanding General, LtGen Stephen P Parreño PAF, and was joined by His Excellency Miguel Utray Delgado, Ambassador of the Kingdom of Spain to the Philippines, OIC, DND, Senior Undersecretary, Carlito G. Galvez Jr., and AFP Chief of Staff, General Andres C Centino PA.</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march%202023/5AED69AA-CAE4-40DE-8164-D6F7AC5AD2D3.jpeg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-03-08T16:25:15+08:00","hits":465},{"id":906,"title":"On the involvement of former soldiers in Gov Degamo's slay","slug":"on-the-involvement-of-former-soldiers-in-gov-degamos-slay","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/Jan 2023/press.jpg\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/Jan 2023/press.jpg\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The tragic shooting incident that resulted in the death of Gov Degamo in Negros Oriental last Saturday, reportedly involved former soldiers.</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/Jan%202023/press.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-03-07T16:22:20+08:00","hits":242},{"id":907,"title":"AFP Statement on the Death of Negros Oriental Governor","slug":"afp-statement-on-the-death-of-negros-oriental-governor","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/Jan 2023/press.jpg\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/Jan 2023/press.jpg\" /></div>\r\n<div>The Armed Forces of the Philippines condemns the brutal act committed by the assailants that caused the death of Negros Oriental Governor Roel Degamo and eight other civilians and the wounding of 16 others, including two of our soldiers.</div>\r\n<div>","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/Jan%202023/press.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-03-05T16:18:19+08:00","hits":171},{"id":908,"title":"123 Terrorists Neutralized, 136 Firearms gained by AFP in February","slug":"123-terrorists-neutralized-136-firearms-gained-by-afp-in-february","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div dir=\"auto\"> </div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march 2023/IMG-ea4363e5deda7f013d9fd24d384226a8-V.jpg\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/march 2023/IMG-ea4363e5deda7f013d9fd24d384226a8-V.jpg\" /></div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City – The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) has registered for February a total of 123 neutralized terrorists along with 136 firearms gained in various focused military and support to law enforcement operations across the country.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"> ","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march%202023/IMG-ea4363e5deda7f013d9fd24d384226a8-V.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-03-05T09:57:24+08:00","hits":214},{"id":909,"title":"7 NPA terrorists yield to AFP in Davao Del Norte","slug":"7-npa-terrorists-yield-to-afp-in-davao-del-norte","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/Apr 2022/04122022 7 NPA terrorists yield to AFP in Davao Del Norte.jpg\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/Apr 2022/04122022 7 NPA terrorists yield to AFP in Davao Del Norte.jpg\" /></p>\r\n<p>CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City - Seven communist NPA terrorists (CNTs) yielded to the 56th Infantry Battalion of the 1003rd Infantry Brigade under the Philippine Army's 10th Infantry Division (10ID) in Talaingod, Davao del Norte, on April 8.</p>\r\n<p>Lieutenant Colonel Osmalik Tayaban identified the surrenderees on their aliases as Mamiloy, Onyok, Trisha, Toryo/Dayan, Mars, Marvin, Dante (true names withheld for their protection). They brought two (2) AK47 Rifles and one (1) IMI Israel AR Galil Rifle.</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/Apr%202022/04122022%207%20NPA%20terrorists%20yield%20to%20AFP%20in%20Davao%20Del%20Norte.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-03-04T10:54:49+08:00","hits":453},{"id":910,"title":"“Don’t quit,” says AFP Chief of Staff to PMA “Talang Dangal” Class 2026","slug":"don-t-quit-says-afp-chief-of-staff-to-pma-talang-dangal-class-2026","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<div dir=\"auto\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march 2023/IMG-a07ba8ab3979472197a3c6f93ac51d28-V.jpg\" width=\"800\" height=\"535\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/march 2023/IMG-a07ba8ab3979472197a3c6f93ac51d28-V.jpg\" /></div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City – The AFP Chief of Staff, General Andres C Centino PA, served as the Guest of Honor and Speaker during the Recognition Rites of the Philippine Military Academy “Talang Dangal” Class of 2026 on Saturday, March 04, 2023, at Fort Del Pilar, Baguio City.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"> </div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">The CSAFP, who belongs to PMA “Maringal” Class of 1988, was welcomed by the Officers, Enlisted Personnel, Cadets, and Civilian Human Resources at the Academy under the leadership of PMA Superintendent LtGen Rowen S Tolentino PA.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"> </div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">In his remarks, the CSAFP addressed four audiences: the fourthclass cadets or plebes; the upperclass cadets; the families and loved ones of the plebes; and the entire PMA. As an alumnus of the Academy, he shared the same pride as a cadet 39 years ago and asked the 310 newly-recognized cadets to “manifest the level of maturity and sense of responsibility worthy of the trust and respect of your upperclassmen and mentors.”</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"> </div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">“In the days ahead, we will ask even more of you, in the fortitude of spirit, keenness of mind, and generosity of camaraderie. But know that the more challenging the times become, the better prepared you will be for the demands and trials that await you once you are outside of the Academy,” as the CSAFP shared one of the most important plebe-knowledges that he kept to his heart, the poem “Don’t Quit.”</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"> ","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march%202023/IMG-a07ba8ab3979472197a3c6f93ac51d28-V.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-03-04T01:51:43+08:00","hits":641},{"id":911,"title":"AFP welcomes new Sergeant Major","slug":"afp-welcomes-new-sergeant-major","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march 2023/2.jpg\" width=\"800\" height=\"534\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/march 2023/2.jpg\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City — The Armed Forces of the Philippines conducted a Change of Chief of Office and Retirement Ceremony for the AFP Sergeant Major (AFPSM) with the Chief of Staff, AFP, General Andres C Centino PA as the Presiding Officer on March 03, 2023 at the AFP General Headquarters.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The Change of Chief of Office Ceremony also marked the retirement of the outgoing AFPSM, First Chief Master Sergeant Rogelio O Obillo PN(M). He turned over his duties to the incoming AFPSM, Master Chief Petty Officer Joe Marie V Lucero PN, who took the post in an acting capacity.</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march%202023/2.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-03-03T09:51:36+08:00","hits":1168},{"id":912,"title":"Be a hero to our heroes' children in the 6th HERO Golf Cup","slug":"be-a-hero-to-our-heroes-children-in-the-6th-hero-golf-cup-2","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"<p><img src=\"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march 2023/HR1.jpg\" width=\"800\" height=\"1146\" loading=\"lazy\" data-path=\"local-images:/Articles/march 2023/HR1.jpg\" /></p>\r\n<p>The HERO Golf Cup is an annual charity golf tournament organized by the HERO (Help Educate and Rear Orphans) Foundation, Inc. Now on its 6th year, all proceeds of the tournament will go to help fund the educational needs of orphaned children and dependent siblings of soldiers who were permanently incapacitated or killed due to enemy action or during disaster relief operations.</p>\r\n","featured_image":"/media/legacy/images/Articles/march%202023/HR1.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2023-03-03T09:49:54+08:00","hits":270}]}